      "id": "teach_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "For similar circular pipes, flow is proportional to diameter squared.\n\nDouble the diameter → 2² = 4 times the flow.\nSo the time for one tank becomes one-fourth.",
